	(text_box "The intent of these dividers is to get a general idea of the battery's charge level, rather than get an exact measurement.\nAs such, the decreased resolution caused by scaling down the voltage to 3.3 V max is acceptable.\nIf more precision is needed in the future, consider using op-amps instead."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
